Subject: [PATCH 08/13] =?UTF-8?q?nemesis:=20Recorder=20page=20=E2=80=94=20?=
 =?UTF-8?q?consent-first=20lecture=20capture=20v1?=
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Mic + system-audio loopback (Electron setDisplayMediaRequestHandler +
display-capture permission), mixed to Opus/WebM via AudioContext, saved through
a new hardened hermes:fs:writeBinary IPC (512MB cap) to ~/Documents/Nemesis
Recordings; persistent ON-AIR indicator, playback via data URLs; transcription
deferred (documented). Wired: route/nav/i18n x4.
